<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Cement Co H1 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi Cement Co H1 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   197.4   vs    224.6</p>
<p> Sales income	     272.0   vs    288.7</p>
<p> Net sales income	 193.8   vs    217.6</p>
<p> Other income		 7.5   vs     11.0</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity 2,078.2   vs  2,058.8</p>
<p> Assets		   2,444.8   vs  2.420.0</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Dammam-based firm, traded on the Saudi stock market, is one of eight cement firms in Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
